    {
      "title": "共学 D8：11 个机会过完 5 问，只有 3 个敢进清单",
      "author": "Paxon Qiao",
      "digest": "第八天把 5 问筛选落地成机会清单。11 个候选方向过筛，3 个进清单（PM 天气、吃尸体、费",
      "content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>MoonPub Preview</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;background:#f6f7f9;padding:24px 12px;\">\n<main style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; background:#fff; padding:28px 24px; box-shadow:0 12px 36px rgba(15,23,42,0.08);\">\n<section style=\"font-family: -apple-system, 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.9; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: #333; background: #fff; padding: 0 4px;\">\n\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Cover</title>\n<style>\n*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{width:900px;height:500px;overflow:hidden;font-family:'SF Pro Text',-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;background:#030712}\n.cover{width:900px;height:500px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:radial-gradient(circle at 78% 18%,rgba(34,197,94,.22),transparent 25%),linear-gradient(135deg,#020617 0%,#0b1020 48%,#111827 100%);color:#e5edf7;padding:64px 76px}\n.grid{position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(148,163,184,.08) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(148,163,184,.08) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:34px 34px;opacity:.65}\n.glow{position:absolute;right:74px;top:54px;width:220px;height:220px;border:1px solid rgba(34,197,94,.28);border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 60px rgba(34,197,94,.16)}\n.panel{position:relative;height:100%;border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.22);border-radius:18px;background:rgba(2,6,23,.72);box-shadow:0 22px 55px rgba(0,0,0,.35);padding:38px 44px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}\n.toolbar{position:absolute;top:20px;left:24px;display:flex;gap:8px}\n.dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#22c55e;box-shadow:0 0 16px rgba(34,197,94,.8)}\n.dot:nth-child(2){background:#38bdf8;box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(56,189,248,.7)}\n.dot:nth-child(3){background:#f59e0b;box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(245,158,11,.65)}\n.tag{display:inline-block;color:#86efac;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:4px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:24px}\n.prompt{color:#22c55e;margin-right:10px}\n.title{font-size:42px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.16;color:#f8fafc;max-width:640px;margin-bottom:18px;letter-spacing:.4px;text-shadow:0 0 24px rgba(34,197,94,.16)}\n.subtitle{font-size:16px;color:#a7b6c8;line-height:1.75;max-width:560px;margin-bottom:34px}\n.meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:13px}\n.chip{border:1px solid rgba(34,197,94,.32);border-radius:999px;padding:7px 13px;color:#bbf7d0;background:rgba(34,197,94,.08);font-family:'SF Mono',Consolas,monospace}\n.author{letter-spacing:1px}\n.scanline{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:62px;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#22c55e,transparent);opacity:.75}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"cover\" data-cover-style=\"geek-black\">\n  <div class=\"grid\"></div><div class=\"glow\"></div>\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"toolbar\"><span class=\"dot\"></span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span class=\"dot\"></span></div>\n\n    <h1 class=\"title\">共学 D8：11 个机会过完 5 问，只有 3 个敢进清单</h1>\n    <p class=\"subtitle\">第八天把 5 问筛选落地成机会清单。11 个候选方向过筛，3 个进清单（PM 天气、吃尸体、费率窗口），5 个挂 30 天证据，2 个暂缓。附 jumper 归零 25bps、返佣 1.9 倍实锤、薄池 100% 出轨率。</p>\n    <div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"chip\">WEB3 · DEV</span><span class=\"author\">Paxon Qiao</span></div>\n    <div class=\"scanline\"></div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">共学 D8：11 个机会过完 5 问，只有 3 个敢进清单</h2>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 1.9em 0; padding: 18px 20px 18px 24px; background: #f8f8f8; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-left: 4px solid #2c2c2c; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(15,23,42,0.05); color: #888; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.9; letter-spacing: 0.08em;\">链上套利残酷共学 · 第 8 天\n2026-08-12</section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.55em; color: #555; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2.05; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify;\">第八天只干了一件事，把前七天攒下的所有候选方向，过一遍 5 问筛选，做成第一张机会清单。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">候选池不小。研究线 backlog 1 到 14 号、Bruce 的 14 类机会对照表、本周实测过的网格和 Polymarket 和 gas 反杀和 TUT 和 DOS，全摆上桌。11 个方向过筛，最后只有 3 个进清单，5 个挂着 30 天证据等数据，2 个暂缓，1 个排计划。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">这张清单就是 L0008 的产物。判断任何赚钱案例先过 5 问的框架，昨天刚沉淀完，今天拿它当真刀真枪的筛子用。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.2em 0; text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border:1px solid #2c2c2c;border-radius:50%;margin:0 10px;vertical-align:middle;background:#fff;\"></span><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#e5e7eb;vertical-align:middle;\"></section></section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">一、筛子先立起来，5 问一个不能少</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">筛选框架就是 D7 沉淀的 5 问，直接拿来当准入标准。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 18px 0 22px; padding: 4px 0;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">1</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">最小有效规模承受得起吗？固定成本除以价差率</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#fff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">2</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#fff;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">净收益公式算出来是正的吗？毛利减掉所有成本</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">3</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">样本只覆盖友好窗口吗？趋势月和极端行情测过没有</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#fff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">4</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#fff;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">收益有没有返佣、补贴在撑？返佣多等于费用多</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">5</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">有 30 天以上真实净收益证据吗？失败的记录也要算</td></tr>\n</table></section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">五个问题答完，能进的候选，核心标准就一条。有链上或者交易所能复现的数据。</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">二、进清单的 3 个，全是拿数据说话</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">① PM 天气「几成定局买稳赢」</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">胜率 95% 以上，单笔 20 到 30%，日化 3%，都来自实盘。600 笔公开案例互证，0xInoo 的交易记录加 Paxon 自己的天气市场实盘。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">硬约束写在清单里。单市场日容量只有 300 美元，天花板压得死。扩展方式是复制到多个市场，但极端天气和多市场相关性就是尾部风险。容量受限是它进清单还能排第一的原因，个人资金规模刚好配得上。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">② 事件驱动「吃尸体」</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">下架和插针和逼空，这种事件窗口才有肉。HFT 下架价差 439bps，TUT 插针 16.16% 的窗口，两个案例都是回测加事件复盘双验证。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">低频，高幅，判窗口靠两个因子。价差加爆仓量，TUT 生命周期里全时间线验证过。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">③ 跨所资金费率事件窗口</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">正常期吃费率，极端期做收敛。TUT 两因子判定在事件全时间线上验证过，吃尸体共用同一套监控基建。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">三个进清单的方向，共同点是一句话。都有可复现数据，没有一条是靠截图或者口头承诺撑起来的。</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">三、5 个待验证，全部挂着 30 天数据</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">筛不进来的，问题高度集中在第 5 问，30 天证据。5 个方向哨兵都已经在跑，到点收数就能出结论。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin:22px 0;padding:12px 14px;background:#f8f8f8;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:10px;\">\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">方向</span>RWA 币股闭市漂移</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">现状</span>周末实测毛 30-100bps，成本约 20bps</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">证据缺口</span>哨兵跑满 30 天</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">方向</span>链上 perp funding</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">现状</span>Drift BTC funding 实测 -16.14%</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">证据缺口</span>成本模型完整化</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">方向</span>低容量结构性价差</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">现状</span>量化路径已定，corridor_series 加滑点分档</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">证据缺口</span>容量乘持续时间乘竞争度</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">方向</span>PM rebalancing 盘口</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">现状</span>论文 1 年数据，扫描器已挂</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">证据缺口</span>信号率统计</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">方向</span>OFT 跨链价差</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">现状</span>DOS 净 7.6bps NO-GO，桥费是杀手</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">证据缺口</span>等新币上币窗口</p>\n</section>\n</section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">挂着的不是放弃，是等证据。30 天数据没到，清单就不给位置。</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">四、暂缓和计划，各占各的理由</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">Cosmos 偏门跨链暂缓，发行方、流动性、赎回路径一项没核查，先核查再谈。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">Meme 壳价加 Dev 状态机不列入清单。博弈不是套利，没有反身性对冲，没有净收益公式，回研究线另算。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">PM 带方向 LP 排进计划。先做 activity 返佣流水的 paper 验证，返佣率对吃单率对胜率三个数出来再决定，激励按可归零建模。官方规则风险当成本算，不当预期收益算。</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">五、当天三个支撑发现，都有实测数字</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">清单之外，同一天三个工程发现，全是实测跑出来的。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">jumper.exchange 把 25bps 平台费归零了。</strong> 16 组全矩阵复测，100 到 10 万四档金额，integrator 参数带上 jumper.exchange，feeCosts 全部为 0，到账 100%，默认参数是 99.75%。L0006 的「25bps 恒定地板」修正为「默认参数渠道费」。跨链门槛整体下移 25bps，往返从 0.5% 量级降到 0.25% 量级。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">LI.FI 覆盖不等于全链。</strong> 拿 DOS 重测，BSC 到 ETH 全 404，连 USDT sanity 都过不去。DOS 走的是 LayerZero V2 原生 OFT 桥，跟 LI.FI 平台费无关，净 7.6bps 维持 NO-GO。聚合器查不到不等于路径不存在，跨链成本按实际桥核算。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><strong style=\"color: #1a1a1a;\">PM 返佣 1.9 倍实锤。</strong> 榜上 0x204f 地址，7 天返佣 9.47K 美元，纯交易只有 5.0K，返佣是纯交易的 1.9 倍。去掉 rebate 就是亏损的。返佣按费用比例返，返佣多等于费用多，这个信号在真实地址上验证完毕。</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">六、低容量量化，薄池价差确实活得更久</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">第 13 号研究线的量化 v1 同天落地。corridor_series 2.3 天 501 个样本，剔除损坏数据后。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">薄池对出轨率 100%，深池对只有 54%。薄池价差持续 3 到 7 小时，深池不到 2 小时，价差稳定在负 52 到 60bps。容量边界约 100 SOL 一笔。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">「薄池价差持续更久」这个假设，成立。副产品是数据质量发现，Aquifer 报价 +150 万 bps、Manifest +12 万 bps，全是损坏数据，雷达得加异常值过滤。</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">方法论沉淀</h2>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 18px 0 22px; padding: 4px 0;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">1</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">5 问筛不出错的方式，是证据分级。进清单的 3 个，全有链上或交易所可复现数据</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#fff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">2</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#fff;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">挂 30 天证据不是放弃，是把判断推迟到数据到齐的那天</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">3</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">平台费参数能归零，成本模型每一条都要实测，不能信文档</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#fff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">4</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#fff;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">聚合器查不到不等于路径不存在，覆盖范围和实际桥分开算</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">5</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">返佣是坏信号，返佣多等于费用多，真实地址验证过</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#fff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">6</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#fff;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">容量是硬约束，进清单的前提是个人资金规模配得上机会天花板</td></tr>\n</table></section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">明天做什么</h2>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 18px 0 22px; padding: 4px 0;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">1</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">L0009 知识图谱 v1，14 类对照总表乘本清单</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#fff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">2</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#fff;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">3 个进清单候选的监控基建盘点，吃尸体和费率窗口共用一套</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f3f4f6;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">3</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f3f4f6;color:#555;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">低容量量化接雷达异常值过滤，薄池观察线继续跑</td></tr>\n</table></section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2c2c2c; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">关于本次共学</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">本系列来自「链上套利残酷共学」，由 Bruce Xu 发起的 21 天实践型共学（2026.08.05-08.26），692 位伙伴围绕机会发现、成本验证、策略构建、信号监控与执行复盘，用真实证据逼近答案，不做只听概念不落地的学习。活动详情见 intensivecolearn.ing/programs/b43d2e97-ed88-4ca3-b12f-7ef672b01205</p>\n\n\n\n<section style=\"margin-top:3em;padding-top:2em;border-top:1px solid #e8e8e8;\">\n\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0;color:#888;font-size:15px;text-align:center;\">— · —</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.6em 0;color:#2c2c2c;font-size:15px;text-align:center;font-weight:bold;\">寻月隐君</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.6em 0;color:#888;font-size:14px;text-align:center;line-height:1.8;\">专注 Web3、Python、Go、Rust 技术分享，探索区块链、智能合约、DApp 等前沿内容。<br>\n技术的光，未来的道。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0 0.4em;color:#888;font-size:13px;text-align:left;line-height:1.8;\">本文为个人学习记录，不构成投资建议。链上套利有风险，请自行评估。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0 0.6em;color:#888;font-size:13px;text-align:center;\">扫码加入「寻月阁」共学群</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;margin:1.5em 0 0.8em;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/22kVflKPKawE6YlDUYJ2bbBaFdUFJFsATL3a7JPk0qSNjFwTk7TQiaW9L3DgSQ3sYQLJmUTFOAkcIwYlvlPoNaDJyIicxPunvsUNnfpsYY7fU/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg\" style=\"display:block;margin:0 auto;max-width:80%;width:240px;height:auto;\" alt=\"群二维码\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;margin:1.5em 0 0.8em;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/22kVflKPKayEkZiaCW73ItmyLDyo8lP0iaBwTibDX81YkuwaYfftsHbDfOzrbXDhIV6DeP5zAXQCPgZbicPibPVq19WfGMSO1U123knIrBunMods/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" alt=\"关注\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.8em 0;color:#888;font-size:13px;text-align:center;\">关注《寻月隐君》，一起在技术的星空下寻找属于自己的明月。</p>\n\n</section>\n\n\n</section>\n\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
    }
